cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Covseisnet: covariance matrix analysis of network seismic data"
abstract: >-
  Covseisnet is a Python package for array signal processing, with a focus on
  data from seismic networks. The core mathematical object of the package is
  the network covariance matrix, used for signal detection, source
  separation, localisation, and plane-wave beamforming.
